('mit-0675', 'Reverse hyper extension (on stability ball)', 'Hiperextensão reversa na bola suíça', 'Hiperextensión inversa en fitball', 'legs', 'glutes', '{"hamstrings","lower_back"}', 'ball', 'reps', null, null, null, '{"en":["Lie face down on a stability ball with your hips resting on the ball and your legs extended straight behind you.","Place your hands on the ground in front of you for stability.","Engaging your glutes and hamstrings, lift your legs up towards the ceiling as high as you can.","Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your legs back down to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."],"es":["Túmbate boca abajo sobre un balón de estabilidad con las caderas apoyadas en el balón y las piernas extendidas rectas detrás de ti.","Coloca las manos en el suelo frente a ti para mayor estabilidad.","Activando los glúteos y los isquiotibiales, eleva las piernas hacia el techo tan alto como puedas.","Haz una pausa por un momento en la parte superior, luego baja lentamente las piernas de vuelta a la posición inicial.","Repite el número de repeticiones deseado."],"pt":["Deite de bruços com o quadril na bola e as mãos no chão.","Suba as pernas o mais alto que conseguir.","Desça devagar."]}'::jsonb),
('mit-1423', 'Reverse hyper on flat bench', 'Hiperextensão reversa no banco reto', 'Hiperextensión inversa en banco plano', 'legs', 'glutes', '{"hamstrings","lower_back"}', 'bodyweight', 'reps', null, null, null, '{"en":["Lie face down on a flat bench with your hips at the edge and your legs hanging off the bench.","Hold onto the bench for stability.","Keeping your legs straight, raise them up towards the ceiling as high as you can.","Squeeze your glutes at the top of the movement.","Slowly lower your legs back down to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."],"es":["Túmbate boca abajo en un banco plano con las caderas en el borde y las piernas colgando del banco.","Sujétate del banco para mantener la estabilidad.","Manteniendo las piernas rectas, elévalas hacia el techo tan alto como puedas.","Aprieta los glúteos en la parte alta del movimiento.","Baja lentamente las piernas de vuelta a la posición inicial.","Repite el número de repeticiones deseado."],"pt":["Deite de bruços com o quadril na beira do banco.","Suba as pernas retas apertando os glúteos.","Desça devagar."]}'::jsonb),
('free-Reverse_Hyperextension', 'Reverse Hyperextension', 'Hiperextensão reversa', 'Hiperextensión inversa', 'legs', 'hamstrings', '{"calves","glutes"}', 'machine', 'reps', 'intermediate', null, 'pull', '{"en":["Lie face down with your hips at the edge of a bench.","Raise your straight legs, squeezing your glutes.","Lower slowly."],"es":["Túmbate boca abajo con la cadera en el borde del banco.","Sube las piernas rectas apretando los glúteos.","Baja despacio."],"pt":["Deite de bruços com o quadril na beira do banco.","Suba as pernas retas apertando os glúteos.","Desça devagar."]}'::jsonb),
